@startuml
title Event-Driven Architecture — System Context

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Business System" as Business

rectangle "Event-Driven Platform" {

    component "Producer Services" as Producers
    queue "Kafka Event Backbone" as Kafka
    component "Consumer Services" as Consumers
}

rectangle "Supporting Services" {
    component "Schema Registry" as Schema
    component "Monitoring / Observability" as Monitoring
}

Business --> Producers : Business operation
Producers --> Kafka : Publish events

Kafka --> Consumers : Deliver events

Producers --> Schema : Validate event contract
Consumers --> Schema : Validate event contract

Kafka --> Monitoring : Metrics / lag / errors
Consumers --> Monitoring : Processing metrics

@enduml
